@startuml UC7_View_Current_Weather_Activity_Diagram

title UC7: View Current Weather - Activity Diagram

start
:User selects "Current Weather" option;
:System retrieves latest current weather data from selected services;

if (Current data available?) then (yes)
  :System displays current conditions
  (temperature, humidity, pressure, wind);
  :System shows which service(s) provided the data;
else (no)
  :System displays last known data with timestamp;
endif

if (User wants to rate?) then (yes)
  :User rates forecast (UC10);
endif

stop

@enduml
